cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "insar-wetlands — C-band InSAR over the Rzecin floating peatland"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sayoud
    given-names: Aymen
repository-code: "https://github.com/AimenSayoud/SAr-adapted"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and analysis for assessing Sentinel-1 C-band interferometry over a
  floating peatland (Schwingmoor) at Rzecin, Poland. Six inversion estimators,
  a spatial-aggregation change of observable, and a weak-signal test protocol
  based on size-matched nulls with empirical p-values.
keywords:
  - InSAR
  - Sentinel-1
  - peatland
  - Schwingmoor
  - phase linking
  - decorrelation
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
